 OptionsTool;globalParms;list;parms;n1;flag;boolean
⍝ Presents a list (typically small) with defaults
 globalParms←##.GUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 globalParms.regKey←'MyApp'
 globalParms.caption←'My App'
 globalParms.icon←#.⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Sample.ico'))
 list←'White' 'Red' 'Green' 'Yellow' 'Black' 'Pink' 'Magenta' 'Black' 'Blue'

 globalParms.hGap←20
 globalParms.vGap←20
 n1←globalParms ##.GUI.OptionsTool.Create list
 (flag boolean)←##.GUI.OptionsTool.ModalWait n1

 :If flag
     ⎕←' User pressed the OK button'
     ⎕←⍪boolean/list
 :Else
     ⎕←'User did NOT press the OK button'
 :EndIf
